{
  "cues": [
    {
      "start_s": 0.2,
      "end_s": 3.935354166666667,
      "text": "One shared world. Each robot has its own motor history.",
      "zh_CN": "同一个共享世界，每只机器人都有独立的运动历史。",
      "voice": "en-GB-RyanNeural",
      "rate": "+12%",
      "voice_asset_sha256": "d901c0afdf3ea52cbcc07e32bd83ba2b94bd0684f4c1f5b4ab0c3ec6847ceaa8",
      "duration_s": 3.7353541666666668
    },
    {
      "start_s": 17.2,
      "end_s": 22.303729166666667,
      "text": "Maneuvers commit to their motion. The opponent sees public state, not a hidden attack phase.",
      "zh_CN": "动作按阶段执行，对手只能观察公开状态，不能读取隐藏的攻击阶段。",
      "voice": "en-GB-RyanNeural",
      "rate": "+12%",
      "voice_asset_sha256": "68d362a429eaf7c51b74cd926695ec4e25f3a7f5eceef233803c75eee9f383c0",
      "duration_s": 5.103729166666667
    },
    {
      "start_s": 27.2,
      "end_s": 29.819270833333334,
      "text": "These are the actual component convex collision shapes.",
      "zh_CN": "这里显示的是实际使用的零件凸碰撞几何。",
      "voice": "en-GB-RyanNeural",
      "rate": "+12%",
      "voice_asset_sha256": "f6a83f20607bc8aa86b7744c58f971b54b0c819348f766a5d1a79316fc29e211",
      "duration_s": 2.619270833333333
    },
    {
      "start_s": 35.2,
      "end_s": 39.63860416666667,
      "text": "Contact impulses are measured by the solver. There is no added root force.",
      "zh_CN": "接触冲量来自求解器测量，没有添加根节点外力。",
      "voice": "en-GB-RyanNeural",
      "rate": "+12%",
      "voice_asset_sha256": "7d2e18e3210a31ef08318ed3d5b2d9b5bb2b56ad5742523c3b4198e2d6f8aacf",
      "duration_s": 4.438604166666667
    },
    {
      "start_s": 41.2,
      "end_s": 45.741395833333335,
      "text": "Tactics choose a skill. Learned motor policies command the fourteen joints.",
      "zh_CN": "战术选择技能，学习得到的运动策略驱动十四个关节。",
      "voice": "en-GB-RyanNeural",
      "rate": "+12%",
      "voice_asset_sha256": "855d26b3a58369509897c40feb206f2dea69a9bfef0401cc1dbd3f5ac9cdd7b7",
      "duration_s": 4.5413958333333335
    },
    {
      "start_s": 71.2,
      "end_s": 72.45433333333334,
      "text": "Stable foot support.",
      "zh_CN": "稳定足部支撑。",
      "voice": "en-GB-RyanNeural",
      "rate": "+12%",
      "voice_asset_sha256": "d60ca70d227616e52ee3ff83b75d97f2ba37cec2b990b4e197a95e44843aebc2",
      "duration_s": 1.2543333333333333
    },
    {
      "start_s": 73.42,
      "end_s": 78.3720625,
      "text": "Ring out and the public down count decide the result. Every body stays in the simulation.",
      "zh_CN": "真实出界和公开倒地读秒决定结果，淘汰后的身体仍保留在仿真中。",
      "voice": "en-GB-RyanNeural",
      "rate": "+12%",
      "voice_asset_sha256": "0b12e7a7efbf98be5bebedf5a2e09b88897f4fd9577af9ec20ae421285bfe6dc",
      "duration_s": 4.9520625
    },
    {
      "start_s": 98.32,
      "end_s": 99.41695833333333,
      "text": "Red team wins!",
      "zh_CN": "红队获胜！",
      "voice": "en-GB-RyanNeural",
      "rate": "+12%",
      "voice_asset_sha256": "ed682fe861f26dae97637075c1820d74767de5dd5d5329063f999e5f534c6a14",
      "duration_s": 1.0969583333333333
    }
  ],
